message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "cas-severity: Injury severity analysis of the New Zealand Crash Analysis System, 2010-2024"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline estimating the association between light condition,
  weather and injury severity in 153,597 reported injury crashes on the New
  Zealand road network, using logistic regression with standard errors
  clustered on territorial authority.
authors:
